# Dev workflow (Windows)

After **any code change** that the user should try in the running app:

1. **Kill** the running instance:
   ```powershell
   Get-Process -Name iptv -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Stop-Process -Force
   ```
2. **Rebuild** (debug is fine for iteration):
   ```powershell
   flutter build windows --debug
   ```
3. **Relaunch**:
   ```powershell
   Start-Process "w:\hobby\iptv\build\windows\x64\runner\Debug\iptv.exe"
   ```

Do this automatically when finishing an implementation iteration unless the user says not to. Hot reload is not used for Windows desktop builds in this project.

Flutter SDK path (if not on PATH): `%LOCALAPPDATA%\flutter\bin`
